Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:00.57,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Me quiero
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.57,0:00:01.98,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}me acepto y soy suficiente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:02.75,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pero sigues igual
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:04.27,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Las afirmaciones no importan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:05.15,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}si no te las crees
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.15,0:00:05.59,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Lo que manda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.59,0:00:06.33,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}es lo que sientes cuando
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.33,0:00:06.89,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}las dices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.89,0:00:07.90,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Sentir la emoción en vez
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:08.53,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de taparla
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:08.91,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}muy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:09.95,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pero que muy importante
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:10.58,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Porque lo que tapas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:11.32,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}se queda dentro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:12.21,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y te sigue controlando
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:12.83,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Pensar en positivo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:14.04,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}a la fuerza no importa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:15.10,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Porque si sonríes por fuera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:15.96,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pero por dentro estás hecho
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:16.45,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}una mierda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:17.27,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}tu energía no cambia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:18.29,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Cumplir lo que prometes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.29,0:00:19.24,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}muy importante
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:20.50,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Cuando cumples con tu palabra
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:21.66,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}empiezas a tener más confianza
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:21.85,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en ti
