Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:37.79,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de lo externo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:38.60,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Mover tu cuerpo
